# What pihole-sync imports. Direct dependencies only; requirements.txt, which
# the Job installs from the same ConfigMap as sync.py, is compiled from this
# file and pins every version the install needs, with hashes
# (docs/runbooks/development-environment.md, *Changing a Python dependency*).
# requirements-dev.in includes this file, so the tests and CI run the versions
# the Job does.
#
# Install with PYYAML_FORCE_LIBYAML=0: pure Python is plenty for two small
# files and needs no wheel for a newly released Python (#483).
PyYAML
# Metrics, pushed over OTLP to the site collector (sync.py's observability.py).
opentelemetry-sdk
opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http
